ct review system!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated talent, quirks and personalities! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Reputation and relationship system!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Mod support, clowns, goblins, aliens etc</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Eras include 70s, 80, 90, 2000s and MORE!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/508660/extras/653f9e2d1511e160ffd9082dde604c4a.avif?t=1791955684\" width=100 height=100 /></span> &quot;Believe me I played it. I'm in it! 100% out of this world!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/508660/extras/d27fd04fc969b4cf4f861bc28c08520a.avif?t=1791955684\" width=100 height=100 /></span>  &quot;I ain't had this much fun since the 70s.  I can go back to the 70s!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
